            "notes": [
                {
                    "no": 1,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Good morning Mrs TestLNameOne\n\nThank you both for coming into store today, it was lovely to meet you and start planning your exciting Florida trip!\n\nI did try to call but appreciate you are busy, I have spoken with my manager and my groups team and can confirm we are now in our Sale! We have also got sale fares on all of your flights too!\n\nFrom this, I found it best to quote without the groups team and have got together a quote for you. I have attached it here, please let me know if you have any queries\n\nFrom the numbers you gave me, I have 20 passengers trTestLNameNineng, please let me know if this is correct?\n\nPlease keep in  mind we do work on a live system so prices can fluctuate and to secure your wonderful holiday we just need a deposit of £175 per person. Or we can offer low deposits of £75 per person also, with the remaining deposit due in 8 weeks time\n\nPlease let me know if you have any queries and I look forward to hearing from you,\n\n\nThank you,\n\n\n\nSophie Mannering",
                    "displayName": "Sophie Mannering",
                    "dateModified": "2023-12-18T10:58:54",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~1",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 2,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Danice took the call from customer and asked me to give her a call\n\nCusotmer had not recieved Sophies email or quote so i have resent it over",
                    "displayName": "Summer Badder",
                    "dateModified": "2023-12-22T12:07:13",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~2",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 18,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Afternoon,\n\nI wanted to let you know our tickets are on sale for Florida 2026.\n\nDisney 14 day magic ticket - £12,029\nUniversal 14 day all parks - £8458\n\nThe prices above are for all of you. \n\nPlease let me know if you would like to take this opportunity and add them onto your booking. We do not require any payment, the total would be added to your balance which isn't due until 03rd November 2025.\n\nSpeak soon!\n\nJodie",
                    "displayName": "Jodie Richards",
                    "dateModified": "2025-01-16T14:13:44",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~18",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 3,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "[1:18 PM] Laura Jane Boudville\nHey hun, I just spoke to the group booking of Sophie’s, I think she may be emailing names acTestFNameFour soon. Maybe give her a call in a little bit if you don’t see them come through x\n[1:18 PM] Summer Badder\nAmazng thankyou\n[1:18 PM] Summer Badder\nWhat emailaddress? \n[4:25 PM] Summer Badder\nive still not recieved anything in Maidstones inbox, do you know what email address she was going to send them in to?",
                    "displayName": "Summer Badder",
                    "dateModified": "2023-12-22T18:02:16",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~3",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 4,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "tried to call customer regarding names and dob of pasengers as laura said she was keen to book however not received an email and n oanswer on phone\n\nWill advise Sophie to follow up tomorrow if do not hear from customer this evening",
                    "displayName": "Summer Badder",
                    "dateModified": "2023-12-22T18:03:16",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~4",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 5,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Hi TestFNameOne\n\nI hope you're well, I did try to give you a call but appreciate you are busy. I understand you were talking with my colleagues yesterday regarding your exciting Florida holiday!\n\nLet me know if I can assist at all?\n\n\n\nThank you,\n\n\n\nSophie Mannering",
                    "displayName": "Sophie Mannering",
                    "dateModified": "2023-12-23T12:03:42",
