                {
                    "no": 11,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Good morning TestLNameTwo and TestFNameOne\n\nCongratulations on booking your exciting Orlando trip for the whole family!\n\nI have attached here your booking invoic3e, please let me know if there are any errors with names or dates of birth.\n\nYou can log in and manage your booking via our app too using this reference 6619029 and TestFNameOne's details\n\nWhen you are able to select your seats, I will let you know and provide the  airline reference also. I have put a request to the hotel that all rooms be near each other and on the highest floor possible.\n\nWe do now have our 2025 parks ticket available with no deposit, and we can price match these if you wanted to add them into your package, please let me know\n\nIf you have any other queries in the mean time, please do let me know and have a wonderful trip!\n\n\n\nThank you,\n\n\n\nSophie Mannering",
                    "displayName": "Sophie Mannering",
                    "dateModified": "2024-01-16T11:25:27",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~11",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 12,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "***** RETAIL BOOKING COMPLETION NOTES *****\n\nWhere was the booking made: In Store / Over Phone - in store\n\nPassenger has been made aware of the importance of providing a contact number for use in Resort:\n\nMobile contact number in Client ID:Y\n\nDeparture date:29/01/2025\n\nFFP/FVC in Client ID:\n\n****************************************************\n\nPRE EXISTING MEDICAL CONDITIONS:\nDoes the customer have any pre-existing medical conditions?N\nIf Yes, have you filled out the Special Assistance Form? \n\n****************************************************\n\nNumber of Adults:13\nNumber of Children & Ages:6 (4,4,6,3,3,3)\nNumber of Infants & Ages:1 (2)\n\n* FLIGHTS *\n\nFlight Dates:29/01/2025 // 12/02/2025\nFlight Times:13:20 // 18:35\nClass:CLASSIC\n\n\nHas the airlines seat booking policy been discussed?Y\n\n*****************************************************\n\n* HOTELS / VILLAS *\n\nROOM TYPE – *If bed requirements are different to standard please detail what you have done to confirm this and is customer aware? -STANDARD\n\nBOARD BASIS -ROOMN ONLY\n\nON REQUEST, has the process been advised?\n\nSPECIAL REQUEST, is your request possible in your hotel, i.e. is bedding correct for the room type booked?\n\nHave Resort Fees, Local Fees and Taxes been advised?Y\n\n*****************************************************\n\n*RESORT TRANSFERS* \n\nPax weight for helicopter transfer:\n\n*****************************************************\n\n* CAR HIRE *\n\nBooked for full duration?\nIf not what are other arrangements?\n\nIs pick up time 2 after landing and drop off 3 hours before departure?\n\nDoes the car pick up and drop off at the correct locations?\n\nIs car size adequate for party?\n\nCar Insurance type?\n\nIf basic package what is the reason?\n\nIs anyone under 25 driving without Gold Plus insurance aware additional cost in resort when collecting car?\n\nHave one way drop off fees been advised?\n\n******************************************************\n\nEXCURSIONS / EXTRAS / V-ROOM / VIRGIN EXPERIENCES\nIf not booked for all pax, what is the reason?\nHelicopter experience - passenger weight:\n\n\n******************************************************\nT-BOX RE-CAP\nApplicable errata’s advised:Y\nNames checked phonetically :Y\nItinerary recapped to pax:Y\n\n******************************************************\nTOTAL COST\nFinal cost agreed including cc charge if applicable:Y\nDiscount used (not applicable to OODR bookings):NHS\n\n******************************************************\nDEPOSIT\nVHols standard deposit:Y\nPublished fare in full:\nApplicable hotel/experience charges:\nHas full deposit been taken? if no please explain why:\n\nLOW DEPOSIT\nDeposit amount taken (£75pp plus £25 booking fee):\nUpfront charges taken (e.g. Hotel / 20 % of Tour / Published Fare / Experience / Wedding Deposit):\nIf low deposit is lower than £75pp please explain why & who authorised this:\nHas a Direct Debit been set up?\nHas the Low Deposit generic item been added?\n***************************************************\nDate remaining deposit amount to be collected:\n***************************************************\nHas this date been put in the Store diary?\n\n***************************************************\n\nItinerary recapped to pax ensuring dates and hotel / transfers match: Y \n\nHave you advised the passenger to check the FCO website? Y \n\nHave you advised the passengers of any VISA or ESTA requirements if applicable? Y \n\nData protection advised: Y \n\n*Password* for other passengers: ozzythedog1",
                    "displayName": "Sophie Mannering",
                    "dateModified": "2024-01-16T11:31:58",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~12",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 13,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Grabbed OODR flight",
                    "displayName": "Rebecca Hodgson",
                    "dateModified": "2024-03-18T09:28:12",
