                    "key": "RS~13",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 14,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "customer called to ask to swap hotels to dockside to save money",
                    "displayName": "Jennifer Lea",
                    "dateModified": "2024-07-22T09:31:06",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~14",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 15,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Price of current hotel room (for each room) £1370.19\nPrice of dockside room (for each room) £1149.48\n\n£220.71 per room difference\nx7 = £1,544.97\n- admin fee £50 total\n= £1,494.97\n\nNew total £19,330.35\n\nExplained this to customer who said it's coming up much cheaper online and I explained I've just priced a change of hotel, not a new holiday. \n\nAsked if they could think about it and call back, I said I'd put the maths in the notes so the next person can see.",
                    "displayName": "Jennifer Lea",
                    "dateModified": "2024-07-22T09:39:53",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~15",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 16,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "customer came into store wanting to amend as agent on phone advised £50 admin fee so i have had to honour. no fees on rosen plaza so re booked dockside and canx old rooms at no charges. \n\nRe sent invoice £50 admin fee added to booking\n\nCustomer happy",
                    "displayName": "Rebecca Weeks",
                    "dateModified": "2024-07-26T09:57:53",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~16",
                    "noteId": 0
                },
                {
                    "no": 17,
                    "type": "RESERVATION",
                    "note": "Afternoon,\n\nJust to let you know Disney and Universal tickets are now available for 2026. Prices for you all:\n\n14 days Disney parks - £13629\n\n14 days Universal parks - £9041\n\nThe total will add on to your balance.\n\nLet me know if you want me to add these onto your booking.\n\nSpeak soon!\n",
                    "displayName": "Jodie Richards",
                    "dateModified": "2024-11-20T12:21:05",
                    "systemGenerated": false,
                    "key": "RS~17",
                    "noteId": 0
                }
            ],
